                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Blue Box is six interesting game concepts compiled into a single package.  Every game in the Blue Box is simple to pick up and enjoy without enduring tutorials or pages of documentation.  Three of them feature Twitch IRC integration (Ostriches, Llama, and Snapshot) which make this a great purchase for streamers looking for something new and interesting to share and play with their viewers.\n\nThese are \"game jam\" games with time constraints and smaller teams but still manage to execute some fairly impressive technical feats and present some entertaining moments.  Oligocene Snapshot in particular is a promising Pokémon Snap clone for people who were disappointed that it was never followed up.  Further levels for that game are still in development but even in its current state it's fun to play.\n\nThe Blue Box is worth it for the variety of simple but fun game concepts on display, but it's also a great purchase for the aforementioned Twitch integration.  There's plenty to appreciate in this package.",
